BT /F2 20.00 Tf 54.00 738.00 Td (CONVERA Project Report) Tj ET
BT /F2 15.00 Tf 54.00 695.20 Td (Purpose) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 662.40 Td (CONVERA is a local LLM inference runtime focused on reducing repeated work across runs. The) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 648.40 Td (public project is intentionally a lite open-core runtime. It provides a real execution loop,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 634.40 Td (local model loading, persistent reusable state, benchmark tools, a FastAPI dashboard, and a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 620.40 Td (privacy-first telemetry contract.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 596.60 Td (The public repository does not include private acceleration systems. It exposes a narrow public) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 582.60 Td (API boundary and keeps internal research and non-public optimization work out of the public) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 568.60 Td (tree.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15.00 Tf 54.00 539.80 Td (What The Project Does) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 507.00 Td (CONVERA runs Hugging Face causal language models from a local model directory. During inference,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 493.00 Td (it records high-level runtime state and stores reusable artifacts in a local content-addressed) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 479.00 Td (tensor store. On repeated prompts, the runtime can reuse persisted KV state and report whether a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 465.00 Td (request was served with a cache hit.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 441.20 Td (The project also includes:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 68.00 417.40 Td (- A command line interface.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 68.00 403.40 Td (- A local web dashboard.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 68.00 389.40 Td (- A benchmark harness.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 68.00 375.40 Td (- A metrics-only telemetry payload builder.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 68.00 361.40 Td (- A public repeated-prompt benchmark.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 68.00 347.40 Td (- A server telemetry handoff document.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 68.00 333.40 Td (- A public/private boundary document.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 68.00 319.40 Td (- A public execution inspector.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 68.00 305.40 Td (- Optional audit trace export.) Tj ET
BT /F2 15.00 Tf 54.00 276.60 Td (Current Public Systems) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.00 Tf 54.00 243.80 Td (Model Loading) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 214.00 Td (Model loading lives in core/model_loader.py. It loads a tokenizer and AutoModelForCausalLM from) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 200.00 Td (the configured local model path. The default model path is:) Tj ET
BT /F3 8.50 Tf 54.00 166.40 Td (models/llama3) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 134.30 Td (The loader uses Hugging Face Transformers and can use automatic device mapping when supported by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 120.30 Td (the local environment.) Tj ET
BT /F2 12.00 Tf 54.00 96.50 Td (Inference Engine) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.00 Tf 54.00 66.70 Td (The inference engine lives in inference/engine.py.) Tj ET
endstream
